WEBVTT

00:14:28.329 --> 00:14:34.246
so much to that job in that position,
I think it's because deep down,

00:14:34.287 --> 00:14:36.787
I have thought, like, this
is as good as it gets.

00:14:37.079 --> 00:14:40.579
The beauty of a one year exit plan is
that it gave Janice time to explore

00:14:40.579 --> 00:14:45.121
different paths and to detach emotionally
instead of ripping off the Band-Aid.

00:14:45.996 --> 00:14:50.621
Janice now runs two coaching firms, works
for flow and before diversity,

00:14:51.246 --> 00:14:54.954
her main regret is that she didn't
make her exit plan sooner.

00:14:57.454 --> 00:15:01.621
One of my favorite ways to avoid that
mistake is to identify your deal breakers,